          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda era yaamukoba ati: “Ika ghansi onone Aaroni mwire naye ghano aye bakabona n'abantu otabaganha kutuuma nsalosalo kwidha ghe ndi, bwe banaakola batyo ndidha kubabonereza.”",
          "type": "text",
